+/* GIMP - The GNU Image Manipulation Program
+ * chopgimp-artboards.c — ChopGimp 3.31.0 (lot 4a): Illustrator's
+ * artboards, kept in the image parasite « chopgimp-artboards » (see
+ * chopgimp-artboards.h for the format and the API).
