+ * chopgimp-pgridtools.c — ChopGimp 3.31.0 (lot 4a): Illustrator's
+ * perspective tools
+ *
+ *  « Grille de perspective »: shows the grid of the image (1, 2 or 3
+ *  vanishing points, saved in the XCF) and edits it with Illustrator's
+ *  widgets: vanishing points, horizon, ground level (moves the whole
+ *  grid), extents of the left and right planes, height, cell size, plane
+ *  offsets. The options hold the type, the sizes, the colors, the
+ *  opacity, the snapping and the locks (tool presets keep them).
+ *
+ *  « Sélection de perspective »: a click on a layer or a vector object
+ *  and a drag moves it on its plane; an object not in perspective is put
+ *  on the active plane (its pixel under the pointer follows the pointer,
+ *  one pixel = one unit at the ground level). Alt: a copy (layers).
+ *  1 / 2 / 3 / 4: left / horizontal / right / no plane (also the plane
+ *  switching widget at the top left). Arrows: moves the last object on
+ *  its plane (Maj × 10).
+ *
+ *  The shape tool draws in the active plane (chopgimp-shapetool.c).
+ *
+ * This program is free software: you can redistribute it and/or modify
+ * it under the terms of the GNU General Public License as published by
+ * the Free Software Foundation; either version 3 of the License, or
+ * (at your option) any later version.
+ */
